cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use REVENANT, please cite it as below."
title: "REVENANT: calibrated causal-rule forensic timeline reconstruction"
abstract: >-
  REVENANT reconstructs incident stories from forensic artefacts that lack
  process GUIDs, using named deterministic causal rules whose edge confidences
  are calibrated against Sysmon-GUID lineage ground truth hidden at inference;
  every narrative claim carries that confidence plus the SHA-256 of its evidence.
type: software
authors:
